			<br />
			<span style="font-family:Arial Black,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;"><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="line-height:normal"><b>On behalf of Qantas freight, we apologise for any inconvenience this may have caused to you and to your customers.<br />
